# This directory is mounted into the MySQL Docker container as /docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/
# Any .sql files placed here will be auto-imported when MySQL starts for the FIRST TIME.
#
# On first VPS deploy:
#   1. Run: powershell -File deploy/vps/export-db.ps1
#   2. The dump will be saved as: server/database/init/payroll-dump.sql
#   3. Then run: docker compose up -d
#   MySQL will auto-import the dump on first start.
